{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"jfj-e-o051b","title":"钟会攻汉乐城遣军攻关口","order":7828,"accounts":[{"id":"jfj-a-o051b","label":"正文 · 景耀六年","text":"钟会攻汉乐城遣军攻关口","evidence":["jfj-q0187"]},{"id":"wgc-a-6-e2","label":"正文","text":"钟会使荀恺李辅围汉乐二城","evidence":["wgc-q0456","wgc-q0072"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"进攻遣军","evidence":["jfj-q0187"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0055","role":"围汉城","evidence":["wgc-q0456","wgc-q0072"]},{"person":"wgc-p0046","role":"围乐城","evidence":["wgc-q0456","wgc-q0072"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"景耀六年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条保留原时间；未从邻段自动继承公元年。","evidence":["jfj-q0187","jfj-q0028","jfj-q0029"],"year":263,"chronology":"jfj-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"jfj-q0028","basis":"本条行动与所列正文纪年逐项核对；现代注释直接释年。原季月保留，不推公历日。"}},"ordering_evidence":"jfj-q0187"}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0046","name":"李辅（钟会前将军）","evidence":["wgc-q0072"],"aliases":[],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o093-wgc-p0046","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及李辅（钟会前将军）","evidence":["wgc-q0072"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0028","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-6e2f890762325a17fefa","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖1〗，维表后主：“闻钟会治兵关中，欲规进取；宜并遣张翼、廖化督诸军，分护阳安关口、阴平桥头，以防未然〖2〗。”皓征信鬼巫〖3〗，谓敌终不自致；启后主寝其事〖4〗，而群臣不知。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0029","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-244c42d136c1fc518809","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-07b5919ab8c7edcb2376","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0187","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-d4a8e1aeaa400cdee772","layer":"original","quote":"钟会攻围汉、乐二城，遣别将进攻关口；","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0072","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"蜀监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城，兵各五千。会使护军荀恺、前将军李辅各统万人：恺围汉城，辅围乐城。会径过，西出阳安口〖7〗，遣人祭诸葛亮之墓〖8〗。使护军胡烈等行前，攻破关城〖9〗，得库藏积谷。姜维自沓中还，至阴平，合集士众，欲赴关城。未到，闻其已破，退趋白水，与蜀将张翼、廖化等合守剑阁拒会〖10〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0456","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"会使护军荀恺、前将军李辅各统万人：恺围汉城，辅围乐城","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
